<!--
  The status-bar icon for a new order.

  A receipt, drawn as a flat white silhouette on transparency, because that is
  all Android keeps: from API 21 the small icon is masked to its alpha channel
  and tinted by the system, so any colour put here is thrown away. The brand
  green arrives instead through setColor on the builder, where the platform
  will actually honour it.
-->
